            148  *       EVAR CALLS THE EXPRESSION EVALUATOR FOR
            149  *       ONE ITEM ONLY, NAMELY A VARIABLE.  WITH
            150  *       R5 ZEROED, THE EVALUATOR WILL EVALUATE
            151  *       UP TO THE FIRST OPERATER OR DELIMITER.
            152  *       UPON RETURNING, EVAR WILL CHECK TO SEE
            153  *       IF THE RESULT IS IN THE EXPRESSION STACK
            154  *       IN WHICH CASE AN EXCEPTION WOULD OCCUR.
            155  *
            156  * CALLING SEQUENCE:
            157  *
            158  *       BLWP @EVARZ
            159  *       NORMAL RETURN
            160  *
            161  *       IN  R8 = PBC
            162  *       OUT R0 = DLIM
            163  *           R2 = ADR
            164  *           R8 = PBC UPDATED
            165  *
            166  * EXCEPTIONS AND CONDITIONS:
            167  *
            168  *       SAME AS EVSD
ASM990 2.4.6     EVAL                       Sun Aug 10 23:07:35 2025 Page 0006
EVAL - CORTEX BASIC REV. 1.1

002C 04C5   170  EVAR   CLR  R5                ;SET FOR VARIABLE ONLY
002E 06A0   171         BL   @EVALS1           ;EVALUATE
0030 01D8'
0032 0282   172         CI   R2,EVSKB          ;# IN STACK?
0034 0000 
0036 1A12   173         JL   EVER1             ;N, RETURN
            174  *
0038 2F96   175  ERR22  DATA ERROR+22          ;EXPECTING VARIABLE
003A 0000'  176  EVARZ  DATA WPR2,EVAR
