            330  *STACK: R5
            331  *       FUNC ADR
            332  *       DUMMY #1
            333  *       DUMMY #2
            334  *       DUMMY #3
            335  *       . . .
            336  *       R8
            337  *       R4 = STACK+2
            338  *
