ASM990 2.4.6     EVAL                       Sun Aug 10 23:07:35 2025 Page 0026
EVAL - CORTEX BASIC REV. 1.1

            825  *       ARITHMETIC OPERATIONS SUCH AS ADD, SUBTRACT,
            826  *       MULTIPLY, DIVIDE, UNARY MINUS, AND RELATIONAL
            827  *       OPERATORS SUCH AS FUZZ, EQUAL, NOT EQUAL,
            828  *       LESS THAN, GREATER THAN, LESS THAN OR EQUAL,
            829  *       GREAT THAN OR EQUAL, AND NOT EQUAL USE
            830  *       OPERANDS POINTED TO BY R1,R2 AND RETURN A
            831  *       RESULT POINTED TO BY R2.
            832  *
            833  *       PREP DETERMINES IF BOTH OPERANDS ARE INTEGER
            834  *       VALUES (IN WHICH CASE AN ATTEMPT IS MADE TO
            835  *       DO AN INTERATION OPERATION) OR IF 1 OR BOTH
            836  *       OF THE OPERANDS IS A FLOATING POINT NUMBER
            837  *       (IN WHICH CASE BOTH ARE FLOATED AND A FLOATING
            838  *       POINT OPERATION IS PERFORMED.)
            839  *
            840  *       RELATIONAL OPERATORS ARE GIVEN A VALUE CORRE-
            841  *       SPONDING TO THE COMPARISON TO BE MADE.  BIT 0
            842  *       IS THE EQUAL BIT, BIT 1 IS THE LESS-THAN BIT,
            843  *       AND BIT 2 IS THE GREATER-THAN BIT.  HENCE:
            844  *
            845  *         0000  =  FUZZ
            846  *         0001  =  EQUAL
            847  *         0002  =  LESS-THAN
            848  *         0003  =  LESS-THAN OR EQUAL
            849  *         0004  =  GREATER-THAN
            850  *         0005  =  GREATER-THAN OR EQUAL
            851  *         0006  =  NOT EQUAL (LESS-THAN, GREATER-THAN)
            852  *
            853  * CALLING SEQUENCE:
            854  *
            855  *       BL @ADDF
            856  *       BL @SUBF
            857  *       BL @MULF
            858  *       BL @DIVF
